            "sid": "REV 8:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore pee ebol Olkuoo le Ker olmishire li oopishana, negira keper te rishata naba anaa enusu e saa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.8.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.8.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 8:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nadol nanu lelo malaika oopishana, ooitashe te dukuya Enkai, neishori ninche ntarumpetani naapishana. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.8.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.8.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 8:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "AMO.9.1"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Amo 9.1",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EXO.30.1"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ena 30.1",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ",",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EXO.30.3"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "3",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Nelotu likae malaika aitashe te mbata o lperere lo lasar, eeta emoti e sahabu nairishoreki, neishori enkorropil sapuk, meitushulaki enkomono e lelo sinyat pooki te nchumata o lperere lo lasar le sahabu otii dukuya olorika le nkitoo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.8.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.8.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 8:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neilep empuruo e nkorropil o lasar te nebo enkomono e lelo sinyat te nkaina o lmalaika otii dukuya Enkai. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.8.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.8.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 8:5"
