                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Nedumu olmalaika emoti neiput enkima naitayio to lperere lo lasar, neisuaaki enkop neaku kumok indarat sapuki o nkikurrukurrot naabuaku, o enkimerlel o nkiwuang'at, o enkikirikirata e nkop.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.8.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.8.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
